{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field of Enemies \u2014 Survive, Upgrade, Become a Legend!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the chaotic and fun Low Poly world of &quot;Field of Enemies&quot;! This is a casual top-down action roguelike where you'll face endless hordes of enemies, from clumsy zombies to advanced robots. Your goal is simple: survive as long as you can, surrounding yourself with a literal hellscape of monsters, and etch your name into the history of the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or team up with friends \u2013 co-op for up to 4 players turns survival into an incredibly fun and crazy battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why players will love Field of Enemies:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Fights to the Last Breath:</strong> Every second counts. Change your tactics on the fly: go for an all-out attack, choose cunning abilities, or just run away before you become prey! Your choice is your path to a new record.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression and Build Crafting:</strong> Kill enemies, gain experience, and unlock powerful unique abilities. Combine them to create unique builds that suit your playstyle. Become an unstoppable warrior or a cunning tactician!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Co-op for Up to 4 Players:</strong> Want more chaos? Invite your friends! Co-op play opens up new tactical possibilities and triples the fun. Can you work as a team when a horde is rushing at you from all sides?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Atmosphere and Humor:</strong> Enjoy stylish Low Poly graphics and... a unique soundtrack! All in-game sounds, from gunshots to monster screams, are voice-acted, creating an unparalleled comedic atmosphere. And during hot battles, you'll be charged up by epic, dynamic music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Difficulty:</strong> The challenge grows with your power. Can you keep up?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Spirit:</strong> Fight not just for survival, but for a place at the top. The global leaderboard will show who is the true king of the battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field of Enemies</strong> is an endless hurricane of action, humor, and excitement, where every run is unique, and records are made to be broken!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648340?t=1761679411","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3648340?t=1761679411","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648340/9d446d703d8b8fe3a41b0649fcdc46fdd93e80f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761679411","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648340/9d446d703d8b8fe3a41b0649fcdc46fdd93e80f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761679411","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field of Enemies \u2014 Survive, Upgrade, Become a Legend!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the chaotic and fun Low Poly world of &quot;Field of Enemies&quot;! This is a casual top-down action roguelike where you'll face endless hordes of enemies, from clumsy zombies to advanced robots. Your goal is simple: survive as long as you can, surrounding yourself with a literal hellscape of monsters, and etch your name into the history of the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone or team up with friends \u2013 co-op for up to 4 players turns survival into an incredibly fun and crazy battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why players will love Field of Enemies:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Fights to the Last Breath:</strong> Every second counts. Change your tactics on the fly: go for an all-out attack, choose cunning abilities, or just run away before you become prey! Your choice is your path to a new record.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Progression and Build Crafting:</strong> Kill enemies, gain experience, and unlock powerful unique abilities. Combine them to create unique builds that suit your playstyle. Become an unstoppable warrior or a cunning tactician!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crazy Co-op for Up to 4 Players:</strong> Want more chaos? Invite your friends! Co-op play opens up new tactical possibilities and triples the fun. Can you work as a team when a horde is rushing at you from all sides?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Atmosphere and Humor:</strong> Enjoy stylish Low Poly graphics and... a unique soundtrack! All in-game sounds, from gunshots to monster screams, are voice-acted, creating an unparalleled comedic atmosphere. And during hot battles, you'll be charged up by epic, dynamic music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Difficulty:</strong> The challenge grows with your power. Can you keep up?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive Spirit:</strong> Fight not just for survival, but for a place at the top. The global leaderboard will show who is the true king of the battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field of Enemies</strong> is an endless hurricane of action, humor, and excitement, where every run is unique, and records are made to be broken!</p>","developers":["Dexied Games"],"dlc":[4082830],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648340/ef1d1f83a16021a3a0d0b35a4b6d300e7783b583/header.jpg?t=1761679411","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3648340/1208751090/47f0278723abbf8b903b5232853be0dfec31de08/1760220240/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760652558","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3648340/1208751090/47f0278723abbf8b903b5232853be0dfec31de08/1760220240/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760652558","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3648340/1208751090/47f0278723abbf8b903b5232853be0dfec31de08/1760220240/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760652558","id":257216213,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216213/movie480.mp4?t=1760652558","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216213/movie_max.mp4?t=1760652558"},"name":"Field of Enemies - Gameplay Teaser!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257216213/33acce12aa10658b5bd64a387b82e831f4c986f4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760652558","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216213/movie480.webm?t=1760652558","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257216213/mo